1
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:06,150
Analytics shows how your trading has gone. Pick a period here, from one day to all time.

2
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:11,510
The top row sums it up: total profit, win rate, number of trades, profit factor, drawdown and Sharpe ratio.

3
00:00:11,610 --> 00:00:15,870
The calendar colours each day by its result. The chips add up the month.

4
00:00:15,970 --> 00:00:21,660
Click a day to see its details.

5
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:28,170
They open below the calendar: that day's profit, trades and balance.

6
00:00:28,270 --> 00:00:32,530
The equity curve shows how your account value moved. Click the chips to add balance or profit lines.

7
00:00:32,630 --> 00:00:38,960
Drawdown shows how far the account fell from its high point.

8
00:00:39,060 --> 00:00:46,380
Monthly PnL, your win rate with buys and sells, and which instruments you trade most.

9
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:53,870
Daily PnL shows each day's result. Holding Period shows how long you keep trades open.

10
00:00:53,970 --> 00:01:02,920
At the bottom: realised profit, your deposits, fees and interest, and average wins and losses.

11
00:01:03,020 --> 00:01:05,920
The refresh button at the top right loads the latest figures.

